#. module: account_invoice_overdue_reminder_scheduler
#: model:mail.template,body_html:account_invoice_overdue_reminder_scheduler.overdue_reminder_alert_mail_template
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"                <p>Hello,</p>\n"
"                <p>The automatic overdue reminder could not be sent for the following customer:</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <table style=\"border-spacing: 0; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <th style=\"padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;\">Customer</th>\n"
"                        <th style=\"padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;\">Contact to Remind</th>\n"
"                        <th style=\"padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;\">Overdue Invoices</th>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td style=\"padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.display_name or ''\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.display_name or ''\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;\">\n"
"                            <t t-foreach=\"object.invoice_ids\" t-as=\"inv\">\n"
"                                <t t-out=\"inv.name\"/>\n"
"                            </t>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                </table>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <strong>Reason:</strong>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.error or ''\"/>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Please fix the problem (for example a missing e-mail address on the contact) so that the reminder is sent at the next run of the automatic reminder.</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Regards,</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <t t-if=\"user.signature\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"user.signature or ''\"/>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </t>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"                <p>Bonjour,</p>\n"
"                <p>La relance automatique n'a pas pu être envoyée pour le client suivant :</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <table style=\"border-spacing: 0; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <th style=\"padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;\">Client</th>\n"
"                        <th style=\"padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;\">Contact à relancer</th>\n"
"                        <th style=\"padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;\">Factures échues</th>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td style=\"padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.display_name or ''\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.display_name or ''\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"padding: 5px; border: 1px solid black;\">\n"
"                            <t t-foreach=\"object.invoice_ids\" t-as=\"inv\">\n"
"                                <t t-out=\"inv.name\"/>\n"
"                            </t>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                </table>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <strong>Raison :</strong>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.error or ''\"/>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Merci de corriger le problème (par exemple une adresse e-mail manquante sur le contact) afin que la relance soit envoyée lors de la prochaine exécution de la relance automatique.</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Cordialement,</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <t t-if=\"user.signature\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"user.signature or ''\"/>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </t>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "

